---
name: "Auto Fix"
description: "Fixes the problems reported by the review"
tags: [check, review]
stage: check
---
`openspec/changes/issue-${{ issue.number }}/review.md` lists the problems found by the review.
Fix every one of them, then verify with the relevant build and test commands.

You may be interrupted at any time: commit incrementally and keep your progress
notes current.

Do not edit `review.md` — the next review task regenerates it.
